Every package of fixture.

- [\`fixture.java\`](fixture/java/index.md) (1 abstract class, 1 annotation interface, 7 class, 2 enum class, 1 exception, 3 interface, 1 record, 1 sealed interface): Shapes, units and measurements: a fixture that exercises every declaration kind and documentation construct the API model represents.
