exports[`index pages Markdown snapshots of the fixture's index pages: types.md 1`] = `
"---
title: "All types"
description: "All types: every type, nested ones too, by name."
kind: "index"
module: "fixture"
version: "1.0"
---

# All types

Every type of fixture, nested ones too, by name.

- [\`AbstractCanvas\`](fixture/java/AbstractCanvas.md), abstract class in fixture.java: A canvas that counts what it draws.
- [\`Box\`](fixture/java/Box.md), class in fixture.java: A mutable holder for one comparable value.
- [\`Builder\`](fixture/java/Polygon.Builder.md), class in fixture.java: Builds a polygon one side at a time.
- [\`Canvas\`](fixture/java/Canvas.md), interface in fixture.java: Somewhere to draw shapes.
- [\`Circle\`](fixture/java/Circle.md), record in fixture.java: A circle.
- [\`Edge\`](fixture/java/Polygon.Edge.md), class in fixture.java: One edge of this polygon: an inner class, bound to its polygon.
- [\`Geometry\`](fixture/java/Geometry.md), class in fixture.java: Operations on [\`shapes\`](fixture/java/Shape.md).
- [\`GeometryException\`](fixture/java/GeometryException.md), exception in fixture.java: A shape that cannot exist, such as a triangle whose sides violate the triangle inequality.
- [\`Kind\`](fixture/java/Canvas.Layer.Kind.md), enum class in fixture.java: What a layer holds.
- [\`Layer\`](fixture/java/Canvas.Layer.md), interface in fixture.java: One layer of a canvas.
- [\`Legacy\`](fixture/java/Geometry.Legacy.md), class in fixture.java: Methods from before null markings; their nullness is unspecified.
- [\`Measured\`](fixture/java/Measured.md), annotation interface in fixture.java: Marks a declaration whose values are lengths, and in which unit.
- [\`Polygon\`](fixture/java/Polygon.md), class in fixture.java: A regular polygon.
- [\`Rect\`](fixture/java/Rect.md), class in fixture.java: An axis-aligned rectangle.
- [\`Shape\`](fixture/java/Shape.md), sealed interface in fixture.java: A closed plane figure.
- [\`ShapeReader\`](fixture/java/io/ShapeReader.md), class in fixture.java.io: Reads shapes in their [text form](fixture/java/Geometry.md#parse%28java.lang.String%29), one per line.
- [\`Units\`](fixture/java/Units.md), enum class in fixture.java: Units of length.
- [\`Visitor\`](fixture/java/Shape.Visitor.md), interface in fixture.java: Operations over each kind of shape.
"
`;

