exports[`index pages Markdown snapshots of the fixture's index pages: deprecated.md 1`] = `
"---
title: "Deprecated"
description: "Deprecated: everything deprecated, for removal first."
kind: "index"
module: "fixture"
version: "1.0"
---

# Deprecated

Everything deprecated in fixture; what will be removed comes first.

## Members

- [\`sum(List)\`](fixture/java/Geometry.md#sum%28java.util.List%29), method in Geometry (deprecated for removal) Since 1.1. Use [\`totalArea(Shape...)\`](fixture/java/Geometry.md#totalArea%28fixture.java.Shape...%29), which takes any number of shapes.
- [\`FEET\`](fixture/java/Units.md#FEET), enum constant in Units (deprecated) Since 1.2. Use [\`METERS\`](fixture/java/Units.md#METERS); mixing units causes rounding errors.
"
`;
